<title>USA: PacificAmerica sets one-for-one stock div.</title>
<headline>PacificAmerica sets one-for-one stock div.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PacificAmerica Money Center Inc Thursday announced a one-for-one stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend will double the amount of shares the company has outstanding. At the end of March PacificAmerica had about 2.35 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be effective for all stockholders of record as of July 31.</p>
<p>The company said it hopes the dividend will increase liquidity of the company's stock.</p>
</text>
